                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Dynamic Value List fixture



steady      - options fixed; one pick = one solve, then quiet.

convergent  - options follow `count`; shrink it below the

              selection to force exactly one re-pick.

oscillate   - DISABLED. Enable the 'oscillate' script to emit

              all options except the selected one; the stall

              detector must cap this and warn.



consumer throws on an empty selection - a regression that

dispatches empty turns this fixture red.</item>
